      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `3b7e098eb0d8ec4bdb7923a7e0195448e23dcccb82d79b3421732676a3147fa4--criminal-courts-australia-2009-10-cube-4-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2009-10\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 12 of 12\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 3ca1863f1f57f83c1bc25668f3a8c8cdcf6e2413f73bc1c68fadbdc94f5695cd | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 9e9ae45cc03dbc12517d2ab1c77ea192f547ed3b075d155c98e683fd57efa612 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 147069503d5bffe3a078b8b4c7b6929054db0789ee5661fdd815b97128ce3b6d | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 956bc3326d7ef44ffb3651760679526393c4cf2cdf4d9f1726e2dd594f04bd3a | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | d5034e8f54cb4513c104def5a61c6c70f9938cbdf4b46771a4bacca31d24eba4 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | fe1c0c4438d7579dfac1fdf4720ff6320d96cc91eb160f4a7d9a488d96c1f0e7 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 390156bbb1a5241e39b5e38dd05fa8647c32da4b1520ac11ce31bc215eaf1ca8 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | f0f79dffb67caae4daced707ea15a9d7df9901beab6d115ae03f489f70bf0199 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 38bd5f20fd27dae67e619a103f8e2057abfbb90c256495d62dfb6c44c22e8596 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 9785cd7c2241b75e019aded9a3108beb511b9f7f6ef12b77ac95026913901642 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 150833a3f039b5ec6407a75d29cdc064d571cdb5d27460e2e6b5f48a96850a82 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | becd94dc79b09cd778e6857e963f83dbbb446644dc79ffe277bcce0162d096b1 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new